  "body": "Attention to builders, investors, home seekers! One of the few new land opportunities on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, combining central convenience, coastal lifestyle and premium modern living in a brand-new community.\r\n\r\nLocation, location, location:\r\n• Nestled in the heart of Stanmore Bay, just steps from New World, local shops, and daily amenities.\r\n• Game-changing connectivity via Penlink (under construction): Right beside the future Penlink access, offering direct SH1 connectivity to the North Shore and CBD. Also next to the peninsula’s future transport hub, including the NX2 extension, for effortless connectivity.\r\n• Moments from Stanmore Bay Beach and Stanmore Bay Park, embracing an effortless coastal lifestyle.\r\n• Tucked away in a quiet, peaceful residential setting, giving you coastal tranquillity without compromising on central connectivity.\r\n• Perfectly positioned within easy reach of well-regarded schools, including Stanmore Bay School and Whangaparaoa College.\r\n\r\nSection Highlights:\r\n• Pristine, master-planned enclave featuring elevated positions, lush green surroundings, and wide-open views.\r\n• Generous sections ranging from approximately 400 sqm+ to 600 sqm+, creating a generous sense of space, privacy and effortless comfort for refined family living.\r\n• Versatile contours offer the choice of elevated sites capturing expansive outlooks, or gentle slopes tailor-made for effortless, single-level living.\r\n• Fully serviced, titled sections with completed vehicle crossings ready for development.\r\n• Flexible Financing: Builder's Terms available for up to 12 months, with up to 80% financing for section purchases through our business partner, plus construction loan financing of up to 80%, subject to lending criteria.\r\n\r\nSecure Your Section:\r\n• 9 Whenuateitei (Lot 12): 451 sqm more or less\r\n• 35 Whenuateitei (Lot 25): 479 sqm more or less\r\n• 4 Pamu Wera (Lot 45): 535 sqm more or less\r\n• 14 Pamu Wera (Lot 37): 445 sqm more or less\r\n• 2 Hau Tapu (Lot 47): 550 sqm more or less\r\n• 3 Hau Tapu (Lot 40): 443 sqm more or less\r\n• 5 Hau Tapu (Lot 41): 450 sqm more or less\r\n• 11 Hau Tapu (Lot 44): 451 sqm more or less\r\n• 10 Hau Tapu (Lot 51): 600 sqm more or less\r\n• 18 Hau Tapu (Lot 55): 629 sqm more or less\r\n\r\nTime to act fast. Secure your place in one of the peninsula’s most exciting new communities, with quality homes already taking shape. Be among the first to join the peninsula’s next growth hotspot. Call now!",
